{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_3_level_main_03-06_end",
  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-06",
  "title": "决定",
  "storyCode": "3-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fb35c3913d8c4c54bf2ae04ef80512c495b3a53181119b38a1b58c779eee4337",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十八关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能！不可能......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎，怎么会这样！碎骨，碎骨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别，别让米莎看见，这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快让那几个懂急救的过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可恶，梅菲斯特为什么不肯来，他在干什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说什么另有计划......究竟在搞什么鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有他在的话，我们能救回很多人啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指望那个不重视同伴的家伙，有点不太现实吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没办法的事情，别太自责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你掩护我们，W......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少，我们把他带回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感谢要用实际行动哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。我们会掩护你撤退......只是，有一个请求——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请一定保护好米莎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是当然，毕竟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟我还有利用价值，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......让我和碎骨单独待会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来......照看他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W，说好了。你一定要做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的好的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说的是—————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我和碎骨单独待会儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是你该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过不了多久，龙门和罗德岛就会攻进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些殿后的整合运动也会死去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊呀啊呀，真麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米莎，因为你，会有那么多人死去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真遗憾呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你开始让我感到厌烦了，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是没法从我这里得到任何东西的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哇，好可怕~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那只小兔子，还挺在乎你的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过那个龙门的陈长官可就不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她可不会对任何人手下留情哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许她会为了利用你而留你一条命——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那之后会发生什么事，你在乌萨斯也看的够多了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在和我走，还来得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尽管——要放着这些整合运动自生自灭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的下场，大概已经定下了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的很可怜哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了对了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然你目睹了全过程——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，唉，不好意思，我可没有余力把碎骨带回切尔诺伯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是说了实话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟这里已经毫无希望了呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想清楚以后，就早点告诉我哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一定会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让碎骨活过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碎骨不会死......碎骨是不会死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是他，他一定会保护大家......保护所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是他的话，一定会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都和我一样，大家都是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是......感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们已经无处可去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都是......需要被保护的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碎骨的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必须......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
